  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Curbing Corruption by Building Sustainable Integrity in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to achieving a sustainable integrity and anticorruption system in the Republic of Moldova through the strengthened capacities of the public and private sector entities and the civil society for the efficient application and monitoring of national integrity instruments and standards.</narrative>
